codex
The selector now enforces the correction structurally: `occupancy-activation` only accepts beams with starting occupancy 1 whose elevation-specific `q10·Γ(n)` first clears at occupancy 3. Occupancy-2 cases are generated as a separate two-arrival `occupancy-2-diminishing` family with their own exact-Ψ sign distribution. The 10° quantile remains the supplied `0.42923539`; away from 10°, the frozen scintillation-loss and shadow-sigma tables are evaluated at the live beam elevation. A one-anchor end-to-end smoke run is currently building its physical tape.
