codex
The label path is now aligned with the archived v2 row arithmetic: it evaluates each sealed outcome, converts the authenticated float prices exactly, and stores baseline, every singleton, coalition value, delta, and Ψ as numerator/denominator receipts. This both preserves old-pair comparability and makes the `k + 2` claim auditable rather than merely asserted.
