codex
The first smoke exposed a normalization mismatch at the final float boundary: the exact objective used the archived float price, but I initially divided Ψ by the pre-float rational calibration. That has been corrected so both the preserved pair row and the independent receipt use the same authenticated v2 convention. The rerun is rebuilding the tape; no source or engine files were modified.
