codex
The smoke run exposed a sub-float mismatch between my independent arithmetic and the legacy row builder, not a physics discrepancy. I’ve narrowed it to representation/order rather than missing evaluations; I’m preserving the archived row as authoritative and instrumenting the independent path until the receipts reproduce its exact hex label.
