codex
The mismatch is larger than rounding, so I am treating it as a correctness bug in the draft’s independent-objective reconstruction. The next diagnostic compares the row builder’s exact objective delta and singleton sum separately; that will identify whether the divergence is in the joint evaluation, singleton cache, or Φ accounting before any corpus generation proceeds.
