codex
The parity issue is identified: the draft cached the baseline under a derived configuration ID, causing the production cross-check to reevaluate that same assignment through a different engine path. The cache now preserves the canonical `BASE:<carrier>` identity, so baseline and singleton reuse occur through the same sealed evaluator path as the archived corpus.
